static const char _zs252_d[] = "reserved member name\n\nA type body declares a member named `take`, `borrow`, `view`, `hold`, `drop`, `private`, `public` or `tag`, or a unit declares a definition named one of the first seven. Those seven are ownership/access markers in member position, and `tag` is the arm tag every sum type carries. Rename it; the visibility declarations `public:`/`private:` naming a unit block remain valid.";
